    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "No metric on the NATS handoff to Module 04",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "`MarketplaceEventPublisherService.publishClaimApproved`/`publishSwapExecuted` (the actual Module 04 handoff, ADR-0089) has no Prometheus metric for publish latency or success/failure rate - a failed publish is only visible via this service's own logs (`logger.warn`), not `/metrics` or an alert. A real, accepted gap (docs/module-07-phase-8-production-readiness-checklist.md), not fixed this phase - see the checklist for why it was deprioritized relative to the SLOs this dashboard's other panels cover."
      }
